# SpiderFoot — Automated OSINT At Scale

One target. 200+ modules. Thousands of data points.

## What is SpiderFoot?
Free open-source OSINT automation tool that collects
intelligence about a target from 200+ data sources.
Give it a domain, IP, email, or username — it does the rest.

## What it Collects
→ Email addresses & employee names
→ Subdomains & IP addresses
→ Breached credentials
→ Open ports & technologies
→ Dark web mentions
→ DNS & WHOIS records
→ Geolocation data

## Installation
pip3 install spiderfoot

OR via git:
git clone https://github.com/smicallef/spiderfoot
cd spiderfoot
pip3 install -r requirements.txt

## Launch Web UI
python3 sf.py -l 127.0.0.1:5001
Then open: http://127.0.0.1:5001

## Commands
python3 sf.py -s target.com -t domain      scan domain
python3 sf.py -s email@x.com -t email      scan email
python3 sf.py -s 192.168.1.1 -t ip         scan IP
python3 sf.py -s username -t username      scan username
python3 sf.py -M                           list all modules
python3 sf.py -s target.com -o output.csv  save results

## Use Cases
→ Penetration testing recon
